FireSim manager: use ~/firesim.pem only if it exists; accept absolute workload paths.

Lets a workload JSON live outside deploy/workloads (RiskyBird keeps its
FireSim workloads in hardware/firesim/deploy/workloads) and lets the manager
run on a host without the AWS key. Generic; upstream candidate.

